---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="Who's behind egusto.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-semibold text-claude-cream">About</h1>
    <div class="prose-post !mx-0">
      <p>
        Egusto is where we write about applied AI work — the parts that don't make it into a
        client deck. Mostly notes on consulting with AI tools day to day: what turns into a
        reusable Claude Skill, what doesn't, and what breaks along the way.
      </p>
      <p>
        The store shares some of the Claude Skills we've built for our own engagements — a
        few free to download, a few available as paid templates for teams who want the
        finished version instead of building it themselves.
      </p>
      <p>
        Posts here are drafted and refined in Claude, illustrated with Canva-generated
        covers, and pushed straight to this site as Markdown — no CMS, no build step to write
        a post.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
